# reading 2 of aquinas-first-way.md by claude-opus-5-5
logic	s5
atom	some_motion	in the world some things are in motion
atom	in_potency	whatever is in motion is in potentiality to that towards which it is in motion
atom	mover_in_act	a thing moves inasmuch as it is in act
atom	motion_is_reduction	motion is nothing else than the reduction of something from potentiality to actuality
atom	reduction_needs_actual	nothing can be reduced from potentiality to actuality except by something in a state of actuality
atom	act_pot_same	the same thing is at once in actuality and potentiality in the same respect
atom	self_mover	a thing is both mover and moved in the same respect and way, i.e. moves itself
atom	moved_by_another	whatever is in motion is put in motion by another
atom	mover_moved	that by which a thing is put in motion is itself put in motion
atom	series_continues	the mover is in turn put in motion by another, and that by another again
atom	infinite_regress	the series of movers goes on to infinity
atom	first_mover	there is a first mover
atom	subsequent_depend	subsequent movers move only inasmuch as they are put in motion by the first mover
atom	other_movers	there is any other mover
atom	first_unmoved	we arrive at a first mover, put in motion by no other
atom	god	this first mover is God
